{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":534,"skin":"泳装","skin_jp":"水着","skin_cn":"泳装","skin_zh_tw":"泳裝","skin_list":[{"id":320,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/avatar.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""},{"id":534,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/Student_Portrait_CH0300_Collection.png","skin":"泳装","skin_cn":"泳装"}],"family_name":"桐生","given_name":"桔梗","family_name_jp":"桐生","given_name_jp":"キキョウ","family_name_kr":"키류","given_name_kr":"키쿄","family_name_en":"Kiryuu","given_name_en":"Kikyou","family_name_zh_tw":"桐生","given_name_zh_tw":"桔梗","family_name_cn":"","given_name_cn":"","nick_name":"","momo_talk_signature":"落花流水","main_relation":72,"relation":null,"age":16,"grade":"二年生","height":160,"birthday":"08-08","hobby":"翻花绳，读兵法，日光浴","designer":"GULIM","illustrator":"GULIM","character_voice":"小松未可子","character_voice_cn":"陈玺月","release_date":"2025-06-25","release_date_cn":null,"release_date_global":"2025-11-18","school":9,"weapon_type":"SR","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":false,"is_install_global":true,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Medium","special_appearance":true,"spine":[1007,1010],"model":[156,364],"voice":[{"description":"ch0300_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"这是适合夏日的对策。","text_original":"夏だからこその策を。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"我有一个不错的作战方案……想听听吗？","text_original":"良い作戦があるんだけど……聞きたい？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_eventlobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_eventlobby_2_1","category":"event","text":"不管怎么努力，身体都会往下沉呢……难道是太用力了吗？","text_original":"どう頑張っても身体が沈んじゃうんだよね……力入れすぎなのかな？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_eventlobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_eventlobby_2_2","category":"event","text":"啊，老师……！您从什么时候开始看的……？","text_original":"せっ、先生……！いつから見てたの……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_eventlobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_eventlobby_3","category":"event","text":"没什么好担心的，这点小事，没什么大不了。","text_original":"心配するほどじゃない。この程度、大したことないから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_eventlobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_eventlobby_4_1","category":"event","text":"有点痒呢。","text_original":"くすぐったいんだけど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_eventlobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_eventlobby_4_2","category":"event","text":"……不过，我可没说要您离开。","text_original":"……離れてとは、言ってない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_eventlobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"百夜水上庆典吗，我该做什么好呢……","text_original":"百夜水上祭か……私、何やってるんだろう…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_eventlogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"既然要参加比赛……就不能辜负委员会参谋的名号。","text_original":"参加するからには……肩書に恥じない試合をするから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_eventlogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_eventlogin_season_1","category":"event","text":"快要看到终点了……真是一段相当充实的时光啊。","text_original":"終わりが見えてきた……だいぶ濃い時間だったかな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_eventlogin_season_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_eventlogin_season_2","category":"event","text":"真到了快结束的时候，还是有点寂寞呢。明明我曾经是那么讨厌大海的。","text_original":"いざ終わるとなると寂しいものだね。海なんて、大嫌いだったのに。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_eventlogin_season_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_eventlogin_season_end","category":"event","text":"……我没什么遗憾的哦。谢谢您，老师。一直陪我们到现在。","text_original":"……悔いはないよ。ありがとう、先生。最後まで見守ってくれて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_eventlogin_season_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_eventmission_1","category":"event","text":"闲聊的话，等两人独处时我再奉陪。现在，先专心于作战。","text_original":"雑談なら二人っきりの時に付き合ってあげる。今は、作戦に集中して。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_eventmission_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_eventmission_2","category":"event","text":"需要作战参谋的建议吗？尽管问吧。","text_original":"作戦参謀の助言が必要？何でも言って。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_eventmission_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_eventmission_day_end","category":"event","text":"辛苦了。来，这是我给您的奖励哦。","text_original":"ご苦労様。はいこれ、私からのご褒美だよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_eventmission_day_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_eventmission_get_1","category":"event","text":"不愧是老师。这种程度，对您来说也是理所当然的吧。","text_original":"さすが先生。これくらい、できて当然か。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_eventmission_get_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_eventmission_get_2","category":"event","text":"您那么努力，我也不能落后了。这就是团队的意义吧？","text_original":"あんたが頑張っているから、私も負けてはいられない。それがチームってものでしょう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_eventmission_get_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_eventmission_login_1","category":"event","text":"这是本次的作战概览。是我整理出来的……可别白白浪费了哦。","text_original":"これ、今回の作戦一覧。私がまとめたやつ……無駄にしないでね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_eventmission_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_eventmission_login_2","category":"event","text":"给，作战概览。……怎么了？不靠近点的话怎么一起看呢？","text_original":"はい、作戦一覧。……何してるの？もっと寄らなきゃ一緒に見れないでしょ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_eventmission_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"以为我会怕水吗？","text_original":"私が水を怖がるとでも？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"哼，这种程度……。","text_original":"ふふ、この程度……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"把我的泳姿烙印在眼底吧。","text_original":"私の泳ぎを目に焼き付けて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"嗯……不错……。","text_original":"んん……順調……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"嗯……就这样……继续……。","text_original":"ん……このまま……まっすぐ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"吸气……呼气……嗯……。","text_original":"吸って……吐いて……ううん……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"嗯……这就是，老师表示信任的方式吗？那么从今往后，您可要更加……彻底地依赖我哦。就像我如此信任您一样。……能做到吧？","text_original":"ふぅん……これが、先生なりの信頼、なんだ。じゃあ、これからはもっと……とことん頼って。私があんたのこと信じてるみたいに。……できるでしょう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"请您下令吧。","text_original":"奇策をご所望。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"呵呵，不错的判断呢。","text_original":"ふふ、いい判断だね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"……您，您打算玩到什么时候？","text_original":"……い、いつまでこうしているつもり？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_formation_select.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"毕竟我可是百花缭乱的作战参谋……游泳什么的简直易如反掌。……教范我已经熟读于心。好了，出发吧。","text_original":"百花繚乱の作戦参謀だもの……水泳なんて児戯に等しい。……教本は熟読しているよ。さあ、行くよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"教学相长。成长在于不懈的学习。我希望与您建立这样的关系。","text_original":"教学相長ず。成長は弛まぬ学びの中にある。あんたとは、そんな関係でいたいね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"您让我意识到了很多事情……果然，您真的很优秀呢。","text_original":"あんたは色々なことを気づかせてくれる……。やっぱり、優秀なんだね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"我仍处于不断学习的过程中，请您守候在我身边，直至臻于完美的那一刻。","text_original":"私はまだ、学びの最中にいる。完璧になるまで、そばで見ていて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"我会继续不断成长……为了大家……也为了您。","text_original":"この先も成長し続けるから……みんなと……あんたのために。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_lobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"如您所知，我不擅长水，更别说大海了。","text_original":"あんたも知っての通り、私は水が苦手。海なんてもってのほか。でも……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_lobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_lobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"但如果是和大家一起的话……倒也不坏。","text_original":"みんなとなら……悪くない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_lobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_lobby_1_3","category":"lobby","text":"……知道吗？这里的“大家”也包括老师哦。","text_original":"……分かってる？「みんな」にはあんたも入ってるんだけど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_lobby_1_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，这个吗？是百花缭乱的大家推荐给我的。她们都说，非常合适我。","text_original":"ああ、これ？百花繚乱のみんなに勧められたの。すごく似合ってる、って言われて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_lobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师也这么觉得吗？这样啊……那真是太好了。","text_original":"……あんたもそう思うんだ。そう……それは、よかった。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_lobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"下次，我们一起去买泳衣吧。","text_original":"今度、水着を買いに行こうか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_lobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"不是给我买，是给老师买。我会帮您挑的。","text_original":"私のじゃない、あんたの。選んであげるから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_lobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_lobby_3_3","category":"lobby","text":"当然，是按我的喜好来挑。不许反驳。","text_original":"もちろん、私の好みで。反論は受けつけない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_lobby_3_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_lobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"最容易记又简单的游泳方法是什么？","text_original":"一番覚えやすくて簡単な泳ぎ方ってどれ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_lobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_lobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"狗刨式吗？……揍你哦。","text_original":"犬かき？……ぶつよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_lobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"我的弱点是不会游泳，您是知道的。","text_original":"泳げないって弱点を、あんたは知っている。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_lobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"所以，也把您的弱点告诉我吧？","text_original":"だから私にも教えて？あんたの弱点。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_lobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_lobby_5_3","category":"lobby","text":"要想结盟的话，不互相暴露弱点可不行。毕竟，我们是命运共同体……对吧？","text_original":"同盟を組むなら、弱点をさらけ出し合わないと。だって、運命共同体……でしょう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_lobby_5_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"欢迎回来，老师。您该不会忘记约定吧？……您可是说过要教我游泳的哦？","text_original":"おかえり、先生。約束、忘れてないよね？……水泳の授業、してくれるんでしょう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"天气真好啊。那，我们要去海边了。快点儿准备一下。","text_original":"いい天気だね。じゃ、海に行くから。さっさと支度して。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"怎么样？还不错吧？","text_original":"どう？なかなかじゃない？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"这可是为了今天特地准备的。","text_original":"今日のために作ったの。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_memoriallobby_1_3","category":"lobby","text":"来，尽情享受吧。","text_original":"ほら、存分に楽しんで。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_memoriallobby_1_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"其实……我还是第一次体会到这些。","text_original":"実は……全部、初めてなんだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"制作某样东西时，脑海里一直浮现着某个人的面容。","text_original":"何かを作っているとき、誰かの顔がずっと浮かぶのも。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_memoriallobby_2_3","category":"lobby","text":"或者将自己毫无防备的样子，展现在某人面前。","text_original":"無防備な姿を、誰かに見せるのも。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_memoriallobby_2_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_memoriallobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"虽然……我还没有特指是谁。","text_original":"別に……誰とまでは言わないけど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_memoriallobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"……希望今后您也能一直陪伴在我身边。","text_original":"……これからも私のそばにいて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"因为，我会守护在您的身边。","text_original":"あんたの隣は、私が守るから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_memoriallobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"……毕竟我们之间的同盟，可是永恒的哦。","text_original":"……この同盟は、永遠だからね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_memoriallobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"这么关照我……到底想让我做什么呢？嗯……明白了。那就给您一个教我游泳的机会吧。","text_original":"こんなに私に構って……一体何をさせたいの？ふぅん……分かった。じゃあ、泳ぎを教えるチャンスをあげる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"您还真是挺积极的呢……这样的性格……我倒也不讨厌。","text_original":"ずいぶん積極的なんだね……そういうの……嫌いじゃないかも。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"嗯，这种感觉……或许也不坏呢。","text_original":"まぁ、こういうのも……悪くないかもね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"有人说，\"特殊的缘分\"其实往往就隐藏在我们身边，出乎意料地近在咫尺呢。……怎么了？只是恰好听到了这样的说法而已。","text_original":"「特別な縁」って、意外と身近に転がってるものだと言うよね。……別に？そういう話を聞いただけ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_season_birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"今天是我的生日，您没忘记吧？之后的安排全都要推掉哦。","text_original":"今日、私の誕生日。覚えてるよね？この後の予定は、全部キャンセルして。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_season_birthday_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_season_birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"为了和老师一起度过，我可是做足了准备呢……","text_original":"あんたと過ごすための作戦は、全部練ってあるから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_season_birthday_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_season_birthday_3","category":"lobby","text":"……之前就把时间空出来了？好。是个不错的判断哦。","text_original":"……元から予定を空けてあるの？そう。良い判断だと思うよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_season_birthday_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_season_birthday_player_1","category":"lobby","text":"今天很特别。因为是老师的生日。","text_original":"今日は特別。だって、あんたが生まれた日だもの。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_season_birthday_player_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_season_birthday_player_2","category":"lobby","text":"……不过我还从未想过自己会以这副模样来庆祝别人的生日。","text_original":"……こんな格好で誰かの誕生日を祝う日が来るとは思わなかったけど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_season_birthday_player_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_season_birthday_player_3","category":"lobby","text":"老师……您想要留下怎样的回忆呢？","text_original":"先生は……どんな想い出が欲しい？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_season_birthday_player_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_season_halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"因为是万圣节，所以想着变装试试看……。","text_original":"ハロウィーンだから仮装をしてみたんだけど……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_season_halloween_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_season_halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"为什么选泳装……？因为想看看老师惊讶的表情嘛。哼哼，恶作剧成功！","text_original":"水着を選んだ理由……？その驚いた顔が見たかったから。ふふ、いたずら成功。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_season_halloween_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_season_newyear_1","category":"lobby","text":"今天可是正月第一天，所以我就试着搭配了一身既不合时令又能给人留下深刻印象的着装……老师觉得怎么样？","text_original":"今日はお正月だから、場違いで……強い印象を残せる服装にしてみたんだけど……どうかな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_season_newyear_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_season_newyear_2","category":"lobby","text":"呵呵，是不是很有作战参谋风格的策略？","text_original":"ふふっ、作戦参謀らしい奇策だと思わない？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_season_newyear_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_season_xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"这身打扮？这是我无意离开此处的表态。","text_original":"この格好？ここから動く気はないって意思表示。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_season_xmas_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_season_xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"今天我想在此度过。您……会陪在我身边的吧？","text_original":"私は今日をここで過ごしたい。あんたは、隣にいてくれるでしょう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_season_xmas_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0300_Title","category":"lobby","text":"蔚蓝……档案。","text_original":"ブルー……アーカイブ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/CH0300_Title.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"嗯……原来老师好这口啊。","text_original":"ふ～ん……先生はこういうのが趣味なんだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"放松……深呼吸……浮在水面上……真难啊……。","text_original":"力を抜いて……深呼吸……水に浮くのって……難しい……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"阳光正好的地方……在哪里呢","text_original":"日差しがちょうど良いところ……どこだろう","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"这件泳衣……好像有点小了呢。","text_original":"水着……少し小さかったかな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"莲华，游泳游得真好啊……。","text_original":"レンゲって、泳ぐの上手……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0300_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[],"voice_kr":[{"description":"ch0300_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kr/ch0300_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kr/ch0300_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kr/ch0300_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kr/ch0300_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kr/ch0300_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E7%94%9F%20%E6%A1%94%E6%A2%97/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kr/ch0300_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0300